{"seq":57,"slug":"speech-synthesis","title":"语音合成技术","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis","rating":{"composite":3.95,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"语音合成技术\">语音合成技术</h1><p>语音合成（Text-to-Speech, TTS）将文本转化为自然流畅的人类语音，是人机交互的关键桥梁。2024-2026 年间，以 VALL-E 2、Fish Audio S2、VoiceCraft-X 和 VibeVoice 为代表的神经编解码器语言模型（Neural Codec Language Model）彻底刷新了这一领域：零样本合成达到人类同等水平（MOS 4.2）、单次生成长达 90 分钟连续语音、流式首包延迟低至 100ms 级别。这些突破标志着 TTS 从「能听懂」迈入「难辨真假」的新阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦<strong>语音合成的模型架构、训练方法与工程实践</strong>，涵盖从信号处理基础到生产部署的完整链路。与相邻 hub 的边界如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NLP 与 Transformer</strong>（<code>53_nlp-transformers</code>）：提供 Transformer 架构、注意力机制、预训练目标等底层理论基础。本 hub 在此之上讨论 Transformer 如何被改造为语音生成的骨干。</li>\n<li><strong>计算机视觉应用</strong>（<code>55_computer-vision-applied</code>）：其扩散模型章节与本 hub 的非自回归声学模型（Flow Matching / Diffusion TTS）存在方法论交叉，但本 hub 关注的是音频域而非图像域。</li>\n<li><strong>长上下文 LLM 技术</strong>（<code>62_long-context-llm-techniques</code>）：本 hub 的长文本合成章节会引用其位置编码扩展方法，但侧重点在语音序列的超长生成。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径 A — 从零入门（适合对语音领域陌生的开发者）：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>基础理论（foundations）→ 信号处理 → 声学模型演进 → 神经音频编解码器</li>\n<li>前沿模型（models）→ 自回归 TTS → 非自回归 TTS → 语音编辑</li>\n<li>工程实践（engineering）→ 流式合成 → 声音克隆 → 评估指标</li>\n<li>应用场景（applications）→ 对话式 TTS → 多语言 → 长文本合成</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径 B — 快速上手（已有深度学习/NLP 基础的开发者）：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>神经音频编解码器（foundations/3）→ 前沿模型全章 → 流式合成 → 应用场景</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>Python 编程基础与 PyTorch 使用经验</li>\n<li>Transformer 架构核心概念（自注意力、位置编码）——可从 <code>53_nlp-transformers</code> 补齐</li>\n<li>基本的数字信号处理概念（采样率、频谱、傅里叶变换）</li>\n<li>了解语言模型的自回归生成范式</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"speech-signal-processing","title":"语音信号处理基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations/speech-signal-processing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"acoustic-models-evolution","title":"声学模型演进：从拼接式到端到端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations/acoustic-models-evolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"neural-audio-codecs","title":"神经音频编解码器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/foundations/neural-audio-codecs"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"models","title":"前沿模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"autoregressive-tts","title":"自回归语音合成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/autoregressive-tts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"non-autoregressive-tts","title":"非自回归与混合语音合成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/non-autoregressive-tts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"speech-editing-models","title":"语音编辑模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/models/speech-editing-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"streaming-tts","title":"流式语音合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/streaming-tts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"voice-cloning","title":"声音克隆与定制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/voice-cloning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-metrics","title":"评估指标与质量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/engineering/evaluation-metrics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用场景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conversational-tts","title":"对话式语音合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/applications/conversational-tts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multilingual-crosslingual","title":"多语言与跨语言语音合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/applications/multilingual-crosslingual"},{"seq":3,"slug":"long-form-synthesis","title":"长文本语音合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-synthesis/applications/long-form-synthesis"}]}]}